  "prefLabel": "Plc 406.01 Purpose and Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 406.01 Purpose and Applicability.\n\n(a) The purpose of this part is to establish procedures and requirements that apply to routine inspections, which are a vital component of ensuring that public health and safety are being protected.\n\n(b) This part shall apply to all regulated professions.\n\nSource. #14031, eff 8-15-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc400.html"
